# fixes. performance.measureUserAgentSpecificMemory() rejects with
# SecurityError through the existing ApiStatus::kNotAvailableDueToFlag path,
# and navigator.storage.estimate() resolves fixed plausible values instead of
# device-dependent numbers. Gated by the Helium Noise master feature and
# kHeliumNoiseMemorySurface. Approach adopted from Cromite's
# Remove-support-for-device-memory-and-cpu-recovery, reimplemented against the
# seams present in this tree.

